      "description": "eventType 'org.ietf.moq.cmsf.sap' on a cmaf media track. The rule broken is the one CMSF inherits from MSF-00 5.1.13: eventType 'MUST NOT be used if the packaging value is not \"eventtimeline\"'. CMSF-00 3.6.1 governs the SAP-type timeline track, and 3.5.1 requires packaging \"cmaf\" for a track carrying CMAF media, so the packaging is not what is wrong.",
